137_Lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"それでは、今日もよろしくお願いしますね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/UPLvoFOgq4MTlJ8Og45Ylj2BLxSassJw.ogg"},{"description":"CH0137_Lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"私だって、いつもちゃんと授業してるんですよ ……先生も、受けてみますか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/LAZuoNMKJxxFzRLDS9m78ypkpJa1Wnce.ogg"},{"description":"CH0137_Lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"こ、ココナちゃんって呼ばないでください！ 小さい子みたいじゃないですか！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/xPQcbNqPDXjVG1K7iCR2QuSR3ZYYAUCf.ogg"},{"description":"CH0137_Lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"どうかしましたか？ ……え、呼んだだけ？どういうことですか……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/P1LhHj5h3BiGRCAjl2RHVx49L315Ztcg.ogg"},{"description":"CH0137_Lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"ああもう、突っつかないでください！ 子どもじゃないんですから！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/3vLbvnWFjSD4UgBDYqGjkrk06DrAiFgK.ogg"},{"description":"CH0137_LogIn_1","category":"lobby","text":"おかえりなさい、先生！ あ、いえ、待ちわびてたとかでは……その、まあ少しは","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/9AL7QsKHuZ0pOUcUvmzdxPnlQdvRMoaG.ogg"},{"description":"CH0137_LogIn_2","category":"lobby","text":"一人前のレディーを待たせるなんて、減点です！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/3EDw2v8n35U7nLtvYz5onDt0whKyHvYT.ogg"},{"description":"CH0137_MemorialLobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"その……別に、ニンジンを好きになったわけではありませんからね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/eE0GTm3G8WBDk9BrFYghsk1NABKQDsBt.ogg"},{"description":"CH0137_MemorialLobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"せっかく先生と一緒に来たわけですし、一人前の教官として仕方なく食べているだけです。分かりましたか？全く、先生はいつも無理やり……。","text_original":"