"},{"description":"ch0137_battle_tacticalaction_1","category":"battle","text":"我们出发吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_battle_tacticalaction_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_battle_victory_1","category":"battle","text":"感觉很不错呢，下次也拜托啦！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_battle_victory_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_battle_victory_2","category":"battle","text":"嗯哼，那当然！别看我这样，我可是成熟的教官！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_battle_victory_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"这个是做什么的……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"感觉好多奇怪的东西呀……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"要是梅花园也有这个就好了……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"瞬姐姐去哪里了……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"这个可以用来教导小朋友！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"我这里有很多糖哦！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"那我就来打分啦。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_exskill_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"今天的分数是……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_exskill_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"要公布成绩喽！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_exskill_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"做得很好！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_exskill_level_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"一百分满分！给你朵小红花！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_exskill_level_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"下次也要再接再厉哦。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_exskill_level_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"时而严格，时而温柔…… 在正确的时候做好正确的事情， 我觉得这样才是一名合格的教官。 我也会努力这么做的！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_exweapon_get.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"不失为一个明智的选择。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_formation_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"就交给心奈我吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_formation_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_formation_select","category":"formation","text":"啊？出什么事了嘛……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_formation_select.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"我是训育支援部梅花园的心奈！ 别，别看我小，我可是正经的教官哦？！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"虽然我已经是独当一面的大人了，但也还在成长中哦！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"哦，有没有变得更像瞬姐姐一点呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"谢，谢谢您，老师。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"我听过一句话，叫做学海无涯。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"那，今天也请多多关照啦。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_lobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"我也会讲课哦！ 老师要不要听听看？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_lobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"别，别叫我小奈！ 听着就像在叫小孩子一样！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_lobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"有什么事吗？ 诶，就是叫叫我……？ 为什么……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_lobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"啊啊，真是的， 不要再戳我了！ 我又不是小孩子！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_lobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师，欢迎回来！ 啊，没，我没有在等你…… 就，就等了一下下而已……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_login_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"居然让这样一位淑女等你，扣分！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_login_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_memoriallobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"不过…… 嗯，我还是讨厌吃胡萝卜。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_memoriallobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_memoriallobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"只是难得和老师来一次， 而我又是成熟的教官， 所以才勉强吃了下去。 明白了没？ 真是的，老师总是这样 勉强我…","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_memoriallobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_memoriallobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"如果我必须吃胡萝卜的话…… 那下次，我们还来这里吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_memoriallobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_memoriallobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"因为这里是我和老师， 第一次一起来的地方…… 好吗？我可不是喜欢上了胡萝卜哦？ 明白了没？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_memoriallobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_memoriallobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"不过嘛…… 胡萝卜，有时也没那么难吃呢，嘿嘿。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_memoriallobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"我，我说过多少次了，我才不是小孩子！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_relationship_up_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"总有一天，我也要成为老师这样的……啊，我什么都没说……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_relationship_up_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"好神奇，不知道为什么，只要和老师在一起，我的心里就会觉得暖暖的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_relationship_up_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"虽然我是教官，但教官也需要老师。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_relationship_up_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_season_birthday","category":"lobby","text":"啊，我的生日…… 您还记得呀。 诶嘿嘿，谢谢您！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_season_birthday.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_season_birthday_player","category":"lobby","text":"老师，祝您生日快乐！ 怎么样？我可是好好记着呢。 ……我的生日，您也记着吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_season_birthday_player.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"老师，新春快乐！ 诶？！您说讨个彩头，新春要吃胡萝卜？ 我，我们山海经才没有这种习俗……！ 好，好吧，只吃一口……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_season_chinesenewyear.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_season_halloween","category":"lobby","text":"万圣节糖果……？ 我，我可是教官！ 当然是负责发糖果的了！ 不过，我也不讨厌糖果……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_season_halloween.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"老师，中秋快乐！ 这块月饼送给您！ 虽，虽然不是我亲手做的， 但这也代表着教官的心意！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_season_midautumn.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_season_newyear","category":"lobby","text":"老师，祝您新年快乐！ 身为优秀的教官， 我今年也会好好努力。 希望您能为我加油！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_season_newyear.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_season_xmas","category":"lobby","text":"圣诞节…… 圣诞老人今年也会来吗？ 不，不行！ 我可是教官， 才没有期待这种事……！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_season_xmas.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_tactic_defeat_1","category":"battle","text":"呜……下，下次我一定赢！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_tactic_defeat_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_tactic_defeat_2","category":"battle","text":"呜啊啊啊——我要去找瞬姐姐告状！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_tactic_defeat_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_tactic_in_1","category":"battle","text":"好啦，上课时间到。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_tactic_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_tactic_in_2","category":"battle","text":"让你见识一下，教官的真实实力！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_tactic_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_tactic_victory_1","category":"battle","text":"哼哼，小事一桩！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%88/original/cn/ch0137_tactic_victory_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0137_tactic_victory_2","category":"b